Within the existing UI and desktop framework for url loading from 11b, I need it made more generic so it still handles file IO operations in a cross platform way, but it should now also accept web urls. Basically anything a browser would accept as an audio media format. For simplicity lets say it's only accepting served files. Stuff like streams or trying to put in URLs that need auth or dynamically load audio content should be a stretch goal if ever implemented at all. Ensure that the ability to load audio from web URLs or external servers is limited to premium users only. This should be included in the premium source code section of the project.
